\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces ToricGT architecture and training program. Typed graph tokens carry node, edge, endpoint, structural, tropical, toric phase, and optional BGG-certificate features. The encoder combines ordinary attention, tropical ring attention, Soft-MoE adapters, and low-rank certificate probes. Training combines supervised graph losses, BPB or language-model loss, GFlowNet trajectory balance, GraphCG disentanglement, and Toric BGG homological consistency.}}{6}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
